00:29:21.850 --> 00:29:23.610
look young for roles that are supposed to be younger.

581
00:29:23.610 --> 00:29:28.350
So those kids were probably slightly over 18 that said, they were still like, you know,

582
00:29:28.490 --> 00:29:29.890
they kid energy playing kid.

