00:30:00.970 --> 00:30:03.410
They were real, you know, they had good spirit, they're professionals.

595
00:30:03.410 --> 00:30:09.310
And then I think it was Lee and Jean, cause the writers are so involved on the office

596
00:30:09.310 --> 00:30:10.090
or were so involved.

